// Manually merge the relevant blocks into prisma/schema.prisma when ready.
//
// Why a separate draft file: the live prisma/schema.prisma has unrelated
// in-flight modifications. Merging Phase 1 directly would tangle the diffs.
// Once your in-flight work is resolved, copy the blocks below into the live
// schema and run `npx prisma generate` to rebuild the client types.
//
// Companion migrations (already applied to staging once you run them):
//   supabase-migrations/004_phase1_account_model.sql
//   supabase-migrations/005_phase1_rls_policies.sql
